  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Earth Manipulation — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>As an action, you can spend 2 cursed energy to target a 5 ft cube of earth, stone, or metal within 20 ft of you and cause it to disintegrate. Metal costs an additional 1 cursed energy to disintegrate. If there is no ground beneath it, a creature standing in that space falls through. Otherwise, they must make a Dexterity saving throw or fall prone.</p>",
